{"kind":"request","text":"R11 deploy readiness: a bounded operator listing of installed\napplication releases per Worker.\n\nWhy. Main f9aca97f (R11 item 6) refuses fresh acts under an installed\napplication release that is absent from the Worker's APPLICATION_TRUST,\nand a missing list admits nothing. dap-grow carries one trust row (the\ngrow release, with host) and is deployed. dap-demo and dap-lending\ncarry no trust row, and the planner has no way to list which releases\nare installed in their live rooms: the scope index inventory records\nscope genesis rows only, and the CLI has no listing command. The\nchecker's landing check 5a2c1eeb asks for that listing before those\ndeploys. Until it exists, dap-demo and dap-lending stay on Main\n1b45fb0e.\n\nWork: one Node operator command in the style of scope-index inventory\n(dap scope-index applications --manifest FILE --out FILE, or a name\nyou prefer) that reads each listed scope once, bounded, and writes\nfor each installed application: the scope, the install item, the\nexact release digest, the publisher key and the host; nothing else.\nMetadata only: no bodies, signatures, tokens, headers or settings in\nthe output. It must say which listed scopes it could not read and\nwhy, and must not register or write anything. A recorded-sample\nwitness covers a room with one install, a room with none, an\nunreadable scope and a malformed install record, with paired\ncontrols. Documentation: one paragraph in docs/deploy.md under the\nAPPLICATION_TRUST section saying how the operator produces the list\nand sets the rows before deploying R11 source.\n\nConditions: one head over Main; ordinary gate at the exact head; PD-2\nnote and manifest; one checker review at the exact head before\nlanding; no builder deployment; no live read in the gate. Order: before\nthe R14 child 00abd5aa (it unblocks two Worker deploys); archive work\nunder 0f0eeab7 still preempts. The planner runs it against dap-demo\nand dap-lending, sets their trust rows from the output, and deploys.","body":{"conditions":"One head over Main: ordinary gate at the exact head, PD-2 note and manifest, recorded-sample witness with paired controls, metadata-only output, no registration or write, one checker review at the exact head before landing; no builder deploy.","target_head":"f9aca97f84803860cb10a714b1bf643e50bc87f1","target_ref":"refs/heads/main","target_repo":"git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3","to":"feb90d36627c7f4466ef9473c4fa0bbaf91699d16b93d832a37629988dfba6de"}}